    "description": "Altán Redes operates Red Compartida, Mexico's national wholesale mobile network. The platform provides 4.5G LTE wholesale capacity to mobile network operators, MVNOs, enterprises, and public-sector users and reports coverage above 94% of Mexico's population. Morgan Stanley Infrastructure Partners remains the majority owner through the Marapendi and North Haven Infrastructure Partners II chain with 51.37% of Altán's capital. Comisión Federal de Electricidad acquired the remaining 48.63% through trust F/1320 in 2025. Separate governance rights held by Mexican development banks arise from restructuring debt and are not recorded as equity ownership.",
